---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '如何预订和乘坐中国高铁：逐步指南';
const description = 'Step-by-step guide to booking tickets, navigating the station, and riding high-speed trains in China.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/transport/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Transport
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🚄 火车</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        How to Book and Ride China High-Speed Rail
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">在中国预订车票、导航车站和乘坐高铁的逐步指南。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读6分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        Book tickets on <strong>Trip.com</strong> (easiest for foreigners) or <strong>12306</strong> (official). Second class is perfectly comfortable. Arrive 30–40 minutes early — your <strong>护照就是你的票</strong>, so keep it handy. Boarding is smooth: security check → waiting hall → gate → platform. Stations have English signs throughout.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#booking" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎫 预订您的机票</a></li>
        <li><a href="#classes" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💺 门票类别</a></li>
        <li><a href="#station" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚉 在车站</a></li>
        <li><a href="#onboard" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚄 机载提示</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">

      <h2 id="booking" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🎫 预订您的机票</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">您有三个选择：</p>

      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>Trip.com（推荐）：</strong> Pulls ticket data directly from 12306. No separate 12306 account needed. After booking, you can board with just your passport.</li>
        <li><strong>12306（官方）：</strong> The official sales channel with better privacy protection. Foreigners can register with their passport number.</li>
        <li><strong>车站售票柜台：</strong> You can buy tickets in person, but English is not guaranteed.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">对于大多数旅行者来说，Trip.com是最简单的选择。小小的预订费值得这么方便。</p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">门票类别</h2>

      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>二等舱：</strong> The standard option. Comfortable seats, 3+2 configuration. This is what most people choose.</li>
        <li><strong>头等舱：</strong> Wider seats, 2+2 configuration, more legroom. Worth upgrading for journeys over 3 hours.</li>
        <li><strong>商务舱：</strong> Fully reclining seats, privacy, complimentary meals on long routes. Expensive but an experience.</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">在车站</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">出发前30-40分钟到达。流程如下：</p>

      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>安全检查：</strong> Bags go through an X-ray machine (like at the airport, but faster).</li>
        <li><strong>候车大厅：</strong> Check the big screen for your train’s gate number. Follow the signs.</li>
        <li><strong>寄宿：</strong> Present your passport at the ticket gate. Use the far-side manual counter lane, then proceed downstairs to the platform.</li>
        <li><strong>找到你的马车：</strong> Check the screens near the platform stairs for the color code assigned to your train. Match this color with the colored floor markers on the platform to locate your correct carriage.</li>
      </ol>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">机载提示</h2>

      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li>食物和饮料从手推车上出售。</li>
        <li>一些火车的座位下有电源插座（中国插座——带一个适配器）。</li>
        <li>提供下拉式百叶窗，以增加舒适度。</li>
        <li>车站和列车公告以中文和英文播出。</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>重要提示：</strong> Your passport is your ticket. Keep it handy for checks at the station entrance, boarding gate, and sometimes on the train. Don’t put it in your checked luggage.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 id="related" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 not-prose">
        <a href="/zh/transport/transport-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🚄 <strong>如何环游中国</strong> — the complete transport guide</a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/airport-to-city/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🛬 <strong>从机场到城市</strong> — what to do when you land</a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🚗 <strong>外国人如何在中国使用滴滴</strong> — set up ride-hailing</a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/metro-bus/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🚇 <strong>中国主要城市地铁和公交指南</strong> — navigating city transit</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">VPN服务经常变化。没有单一官方来源。出行前请查询当前推荐。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://www.12306.cn/en/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">中国铁路局-12306 EN</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>